{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>And its flesh.</b> Includes the head and the pieces." "<b>And they shall burn.</b> By logical inference they wash it and afterward burn it, and burn as incense those mentioned." "<b>And the word חטאת.</b> Because it is offered to atone for sin it is called thus, and so the guilt-offering. Therefore \"and they shall purify the altar\" (Ezekiel 43:22) — they remove sin from upon it."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 29, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:39:03.791581233Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}